================================================================================
                         PROPRIETARY ALGORITHMS
================================================================================

This software includes advanced proprietary algorithms including but not limited to:
- Multi-view 3D reconstruction systems
- Custom-trained neural networks for sub-pixel detection
- Physics-based Extended Kalman Filtering
- Real-time GPU-accelerated processing pipelines
- Proprietary camera calibration methods
- Advanced spin detection and Magnus effect modeling
- CUDA-optimized computer vision kernels

These algorithms represent significant research, development, and trade secrets.

